"PaneFilter"
"Panels are not available in the current FAR mode."
"The active panel is not a regular file panel."
"The current directory does not contain any files or directories."
"Use PaneFilter from a normal filesystem panel."
"PaneFilter [%s]  %d/%d"
"Type to filter, * and ? supported, Enter to open, Del to jump and close, Backspace or Esc to exit, Ctrl-R to refresh"
